{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><blockquote><p>本月初提到，PlayStation Store 現正舉行 Black Friday 優惠，選購眾多 PS4 / PS5 遊戲，都有折扣優惠，更是低至 25 折。當我們以為優惠活動將會中止，原來 Sony 已經延長優惠期，更為大家帶來 PlayStation Plus 會籍折扣優惠，不論是成為新會員還是為會籍升級，一樣可以受惠。</p></blockquote><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d229d6ef437f1b2412507ec379032dcbaebc3a4d2babced2a00d580b7b7e459f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fpc3mag.com%2F7290173013dda7162d6a19317d8dc86d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h3>PS Plus 新會員或會籍升級有限時優惠</h3><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9eb334b71a0eca54fcd2ad80fc5a506ddc7852c48d0ce186b2b856c34e4be08a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fpc3mag.com%2F5f21aeb1581e826706bced2e3783d75e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>Sony 表示，由即日起至本月 30 日，加入 PlayStation Plus 的話可享低至 67 折優惠。只需低至 $400，即可加入成為 PlayStation Plus 的一年基本會員。而若直接成為「升級」或「高級」版會員，一樣有優惠。即使已成為 PlayStation Plus 會員，提升至 PlayStation Plus 高級方案也有優惠價。</p><p></p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"494\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/13deaac5bcd0774131076c6997fb196a4827092f5fdb45a8a052c2d2e792eb72/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fpc3mag.com%2Faa8b239254cc5214b5f711c858076c08.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h3>數以百計 PS5 遊戲仍有優惠價</h3><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"674\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b889be1eedad91f53e72ee7d8249fe38a0050a6204dc805132f4fe6eb582aa27/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fpc3mag.com%2Fee0e6450c7ed95fbe09b129185236847.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>至於早前本月較早時候已開始的 PlayStation Store 優惠，仍然進行中，當中多達數百款 PS5 數位版遊戲低至 25 折有售。不過要留意的是，不同遊戲的優惠期或有差異，早前大家經 PlayStation Store 看到的優惠價，到了今天或許已經不復存在。因此大家即使已知道特定遊戲的優惠價，入手前最好還是再登入 PlayStation Store 再確認一次。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><p>連結︰<a href=\"https://www.playstation.com/zh-hant-hk/deals/black-friday/?country-selector=true\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PlayStation Store</a></p><p>來源︰<a href=\"https://blog.zh-hant.playstation.com/2026/11/18/20261118-bf/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PlayStation Blog</a></p><p>這篇文章 <a href=\"https://pc3mag.com/ps-store-black-friday-extend/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PlayStation Store Black Friday 優惠直至本月底　買 Game 成為 PS Plus 會員皆有折扣</a> 最早出現於 <a href=\"https://pc3mag.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PC3 Magazine</a>。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.408093+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":704,"images":4,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T00:30:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:37:31.845479+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:37:29.806963+00:00","content_hash":"fe99282c4ccc7213c778ecd6e2407ff5205aeaa47ae717687a3e5ba0ea7e1623","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}